        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misri geajoar aba Garkemishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA weah heeda Yeremiya was sibaneeda aba badayda eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba iita ng'eanyiida Misri. Iita lugooda Farao siguura Neko, was sugoocheanda Misri, neekeewa ghuuta eenda Furati mida Garkemishi ghayi joar Nebukadreesa was sugoocheanda Babeli aba gweaydeaba ang'wan bea Yehoyakimu was orjeeda Yosiya, was sugoocheanda Yuda:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hinooda Nebukadreesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'asheanda rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Yeremiya gil was sibaneeda was iita gichea ghwaanda Nebukadreesa was sugoocheanda Babeli ak ghabwar ng'eanyiida Misri:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA Israeli, “Ng'ula, aniini gaydalas Amoni was ASEETA Debesi, ea Farao, ea Misri ea aseecheekaaschi ea sugoodigaaschi, ea Farao sea fugiga awali gheang'dean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydayiin geatingeaba fugiga gasa gurooruunatka nyaawa ea geatinga Nebukadreesa was sugoocheanda Babeli sea fugaaschi hees. Ak abeeda Misri gaygoobiida buuneeda gawuurji eawoojiga ghayi bea garayi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA gayghaweat buuneadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
